---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
export const prerender = false;
---
<html lang="en-GB"><head><BaseHead title="Create a work pack | SafeWork AI" description="Prepare and pay for a job-specific SafeWork AI draft work pack." /></head><body class="safework-office"><Header/><main class="workspace"><a href="/health-and-safety">← Health &amp; Safety</a><p class="eyebrow">SAFEWORK AI / WORK PACKS</p><h1>Create your work pack</h1><p>Complete the job form, check the details and pay securely. SafeWork starts preparing the pack only after Stripe confirms payment.</p><ol class="purchase-steps" aria-label="Purchase process"><li><strong>1</strong><span>Fill in the form</span></li><li><strong>2</strong><span>Review and pay</span></li><li><strong>3</strong><span>Generate and download</span></li></ol><div class="payment-notice"><strong>Nothing is generated before payment.</strong><span>You can review and edit every detail before opening Stripe.</span></div><div class="layout"><form id="pack-form"><h2>Tell us about the company and job</h2><label>Company name<input name="company" required maxlength="200" autocomplete="organization" /></label><label>Company address <span>(optional)</span><input name="companyAddress" maxlength="500" /></label><label>Contact telephone <span>(optional)</span><input name="contact" maxlength="200" type="tel" /></label><label>Job description<textarea name="description" required minlength="8" maxlength="12000" rows="8" placeholder="Describe the work, workforce, tools, materials, access and known site conditions."></textarea></label><label>Job address<textarea name="address" required minlength="5" maxlength="500" rows="2"></textarea></label><label>Confirmed emergency arrangements <span>(optional)</span><textarea name="emergency" maxlength="1500" rows="4" placeholder="Site emergency contact and telephone, first aider, nearest hospital and any other confirmed arrangements. Leave unknown details blank."></textarea></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="reviewAccepted" required/>I understand this is an AI-generated draft that must be checked by a competent person before use.</label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="processingAccepted" required/>I agree to send these job details to OpenAI to prepare the pack and store the order with Trades Go Digital. I will not include unnecessary personal or sensitive information.</label><button id="review" type="submit" disabled>Review details and price →</button></form><aside><p class="aside-tag">WHAT YOU RECEIVE</p><h2>Your work pack</h2><ul><li>Company-branded draft</li><li>Method statement and work sequence</li><li>Risk assessment and controls</li><li>Relevant COSHH assessments</li><li>Emergency and briefing records</li><li>Applicable supporting forms</li><li>A4 document download and repeat access</li></ul><p id="price">Checking availability…</p><p>No subscription. One purchase covers one job description.</p><div class="locked-pack"><strong>Pack generation locked</strong><span>Unlocked automatically after confirmed payment.</span></div></aside></div><section id="confirmation" hidden><p class="eyebrow">STEP 2 / REVIEW AND PAY</p><h2>Check your details before payment</h2><pre id="summary"></pre><p id="total"></p><p>Your pack will be generated after Stripe confirms payment. If generation is interrupted, the private order link lets you retry without paying again.</p><button id="pay">Pay securely with Stripe →</button> <button id="edit" class="secondary">Edit details</button></section><p role="status" id="message"></p><section id="recovery" hidden><h2>Your order is saved</h2><p>Save this private link so you can return to the paid order and download. Anyone with the link can access the pack.</p><a id="order-link">Open / save private order link</a><p><a id="stripe-link" class="button">Pay securely with Stripe →</a></p></section></main><Footer/></body></html>
<script>
const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#pack-form')!;
const msg=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#message')!;
const review=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#review')!;
const confirmation=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#confirmation')!;
const pay=document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('#pay')!;
const emergencyText=form.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('textarea[name="emergency"]');
if(emergencyText){const fields=document.createElement('fieldset');fields.className='emergency-fields';fields.innerHTML='<legend>Site emergency details</legend><p>Enter confirmed information where available. Blank fields become points to confirm before work starts.</p><div class="emergency-grid"><label>Site emergency contact<input name="siteEmergencyContact" maxlength="150" placeholder="Name / role"></label><label>Contact telephone<input name="siteEmergencyPhone" maxlength="80" type="tel" placeholder="Mobile or site number"></label><label>First aider<input name="firstAider" maxlength="150" placeholder="Name / role"></label><label>First aider telephone<input name="firstAiderPhone" maxlength="80" type="tel" placeholder="Mobile number"></label></div><p class="hospital-title">Nearest hospitals / A&amp;E</p><div class="hospitals">'+[1,2,3].map(n=>'<div class="hospital-row"><strong>'+n+'</strong><input name="hospital'+n+'Name" maxlength="150" placeholder="Hospital name" aria-label="Hospital '+n+' name"><input name="hospital'+n+'Address" maxlength="300" placeholder="Full address and postcode" aria-label="Hospital '+n+' address"><input name="hospital'+n+'Phone" maxlength="80" type="tel" placeholder="Telephone" aria-label="Hospital '+n+' telephone"></div>').join('')+'</div>';emergencyText.parentElement?.replaceWith(fields);}
let payload:Record<string,unknown>={};let price='';
const detailsWarning=document.createElement('div');detailsWarning.className='final-details-warning';detailsWarning.setAttribute('role','note');detailsWarning.innerHTML='<strong>Check every detail before you continue</strong><span>Include all known information about the work, people, equipment, materials, access, site conditions and emergency arrangements. Your paid work pack is created from the details you submit, so missing information will not appear in the downloaded pack.</span>';review.before(detailsWarning);
fetch('/api/safework/checkout').then(r=>r.json()).then(c=>{price=typeof c.amount==='number'?new Intl.NumberFormat('en-GB',{style:'currency',currency:'GBP'}).format(c.amount/100):'';document.querySelector('#price')!.textContent=c.enabled?`${price} total${c.mode==='test'?' — TEST CHECKOUT, no real payment':''}`:'Online sales are not open yet.';review.disabled=!c.enabled;}).catch(()=>{document.querySelector('#price')!.textContent='Availability could not be checked. Please reload.';});
form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(form);payload=Object.fromEntries(data);const lines=[['Site emergency contact',data.get('siteEmergencyContact'),data.get('siteEmergencyPhone')],['First aider',data.get('firstAider'),data.get('firstAiderPhone')],...[1,2,3].map(n=>['Hospital '+n,data.get('hospital'+n+'Name'),data.get('hospital'+n+'Address'),data.get('hospital'+n+'Phone')])].filter(row=>row.slice(1).some(Boolean)).map(row=>row.filter(Boolean).join(': '));payload.emergency=lines.join('\n');payload.reviewAccepted=data.has('reviewAccepted');payload.processingAccepted=data.has('processingAccepted');document.querySelector('#summary')!.textContent=`Company: ${data.get('company')}\nJob: ${data.get('description')}\nAddress: ${data.get('address')}\nEmergency details: ${payload.emergency || 'To be confirmed before work'}`;document.querySelector('#total')!.textContent=`Total: ${price} for one draft work pack.`;form.hidden=true;confirmation.hidden=false;confirmation.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});});
document.querySelector('#edit')!.addEventListener('click',()=>{form.hidden=false;confirmation.hidden=true;});
pay.addEventListener('click',async()=>{pay.disabled=true;msg.textContent='Opening your order…';try{const r=await fetch('/api/safework/checkout',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(payload)});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error);const link=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#order-link')!;link.href=d.returnUrl;const stripe=document.querySelector<HTMLAnchorElement>('#stripe-link')!;stripe.href=d.url;document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#recovery')!.hidden=false;confirmation.hidden=true;msg.textContent='Order saved. Keep your private link, then continue to Stripe.';}catch(e){msg.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Checkout failed.';pay.disabled=false;}});
</script>
<style>
body{background:#f4f6f2;color:#17392d}.workspace{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;padding:35px 22px 70px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-top:30px}h1{font-size:38px;line-height:1.15}.layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr;gap:32px}form,aside,#confirmation,#recovery{background:white;border:1px solid #d5dfd6;border-radius:8px;padding:26px}aside{align-self:start}label{display:block;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px}label span{font-weight:400}input:not([type=checkbox]),textarea{display:block;width:100%;padding:12px;border:1px solid #aebeb2;border-radius:4px;font:inherit;margin-top:6px}textarea{resize:vertical}.check{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:400}.check input{margin-top:5px}button,.button{background:#17392d;color:white;padding:13px 20px;border:0;border-radius:4px;font:inherit;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;display:inline-block}button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}.secondary{background:#e2eadf;color:#17392d}#price{font-size:24px;font-weight:800}pre{white-space:pre-wrap;font:inherit;overflow-wrap:anywhere}[hidden]{display:none!important}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b18123;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:720px){.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.workspace{padding:24px 16px}h1{font-size:30px}form,aside{padding:20px}}
.purchase-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:28px 0 14px}.purchase-steps li{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.94);font-weight:800}.purchase-steps strong{display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;background:#f58220;color:#07111f}.payment-notice{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;margin:0 0 24px;padding:14px 16px;border:1px solid #f2a55f;border-radius:8px;background:#fff7ed;color:#7c2d12}.aside-tag{margin:0;color:#9a4200;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.locked-pack{display:grid;gap:3px;margin-top:20px;padding:14px;border-radius:7px;background:#edf2f5}.locked-pack span{font-size:13px;color:#536579}@media(max-width:720px){.purchase-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}.payment-notice{display:grid}}
.emergency-fields{margin:24px 0;padding:20px;border:1px solid #c9d7cc;border-radius:8px}.emergency-fields legend{padding:0 8px;color:#176b50;font-size:22px;font-weight:850}.emergency-fields>p{color:#53675e;font-size:14px}.emergency-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 16px}.hospital-title{margin-top:4px;font-weight:800}.hospitals{display:grid;gap:10px}.hospital-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:26px 1fr 1.6fr 1fr;align-items:center;gap:10px}.hospital-row strong{display:grid;place-items:center;width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#e9f4ee;color:#176b50}.hospital-row input{margin:0!important}@media(max-width:720px){.emergency-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hospital-row{grid-template-columns:26px 1fr}.hospital-row input{grid-column:2}}

body{background:#07111f url('/images/safework-office-background.png') center top / cover fixed no-repeat;color:#10243b}
.workspace{max-width:1180px;min-height:100vh;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,17,31,.78),rgba(7,17,31,.55));padding:44px 40px 80px}
.workspace>h1,.workspace>a,.workspace>.eyebrow,.workspace>p{color:#fff}.workspace>.eyebrow{color:#ffb66e}.workspace>p{max-width:760px}
form,aside,#confirmation,#recovery{background:#fff;border-color:#dce3eb;box-shadow:0 16px 40px #0003;border-radius:10px}aside{border-top:4px solid #f58220}
button,.button{background:#f58220;color:#07111f}.secondary{background:#e7edf3;color:#10243b}
input:not([type=checkbox]),textarea{background:#fafbfd;color:#10243b;border-color:#a9b7c5}
@media(max-width:720px){body{background-attachment:scroll}.workspace{padding:28px 16px 50px;background:rgba(7,17,31,.72)}}

:global(body.safework-office){background-color:#07111f;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(7,17,31,.48),rgba(7,17,31,.48)),url('/images/safework-office-background.png');background-size:auto, max(100vw,1200px) auto;background-position:center top;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll}
:global(body.safework-office main){background:transparent}
:global(body.safework-office>header),:global(body.safework-office>footer){background:rgba(7,17,31,.76);border:0}
:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-brand),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-links),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-bottom),:global(body.safework-office footer li),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list p){border:0;box-shadow:none}
:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-contact-list),:global(body.safework-office footer .footer-links){background:transparent}
.hero,.advice{background:rgba(7,17,31,.48)}
.hero .lead,.advice p:not(.eyebrow){color:#fff}

:global(html){min-height:100%;background:#07111f}
:global(body.safework-office){position:relative;isolation:isolate;background:none}
:global(body.safework-office)::before{content:"";position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:-1;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(rgba(7,17,31,.65),rgba(7,17,31,.65)),url('/images/safework-office-background.png') center center / cover no-repeat}
:global(body.safework-office>header),:global(body.safework-office>footer),:global(body.safework-office main),.hero,.advice,.workspace{background:transparent}
</style>
<style is:global>
  body.safework-office .final-details-warning{display:grid;gap:5px;margin:24px 0 18px;padding:15px 16px;border:1px solid #e6a04b;border-left:5px solid #f58220;border-radius:7px;background:#fff7ed;color:#71350d}
  body.safework-office .final-details-warning strong{font-size:16px}
  body.safework-office .final-details-warning span{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
  body.safework-office .emergency-fields{min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;margin:24px 0;padding:22px;border:1px solid #c9d7cc;border-radius:10px}
  body.safework-office .emergency-fields *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body.safework-office .emergency-fields legend{padding:0 9px;color:#176b50;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:850}
  body.safework-office .emergency-fields>p{margin:4px 0 20px;color:#53675e;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}
  body.safework-office .emergency-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:0 18px}
  body.safework-office .emergency-fields label{display:block;margin-bottom:18px;color:#17392d;font-weight:700}
  body.safework-office .emergency-fields input{display:block;width:100%;min-height:48px;margin-top:6px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #a9b7c5;border-radius:6px;background:#fafbfd;color:#10243b;font:inherit}
  body.safework-office .hospital-title{margin:2px 0 12px;font-weight:800}
  body.safework-office .hospitals{display:grid;gap:10px}
  body.safework-office .hospital-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.6fr) minmax(0,1fr);align-items:center;gap:10px}
  body.safework-office .hospital-row strong{display:grid;place-items:center;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:#e9f4ee;color:#176b50}
  body.safework-office .hospital-row input{margin:0}
  @media(max-width:760px){
    body.safework-office .emergency-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    body.safework-office .emergency-fields{padding:18px}
    body.safework-office .hospital-row{grid-template-columns:28px minmax(0,1fr)}
    body.safework-office .hospital-row input{grid-column:2}
  }
</style>
